OL,3,A'I applied for 200 jobs' - How 'spray
OL,4,Aand pray' AI job applications can
OL,5,Abackfire
OL,6,
OL,7,FTom, 22, from Maidstone graduated last
OL,8,Fyear with a geography degree and says
OL,9,Fhe applied for over 200 jobs before
OL,10,Ffinally landing a role last month as a
OL,11,Frestaurant manager.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
