OL,3,ADavina McCall says memory loss after
OL,4,Abrain surgery was like 'advanced
OL,5,AAlzheimer's'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTV presenter Davina McCall has said she
OL,8,Fexperienced symptoms similar to
OL,9,F"advanced Alzheimer's" following brain
OL,10,Fsurgery.
OL,12,FSpeaking on Paloma Faith's podcast Mad,
OL,13,FSad and Bad, the 58-year-old described
OL,14,Fsuffering from memory loss while
OL,15,Frecovering from an operation to remove
OL,16,Fa benign brain tumour in 2024.
OL,18,F"After I'd had my brain tumour taken
OL,19,Fout, I had advanced Alzheimer's, so I
OL,20,Fcouldn't remember anything," the former
OL,21,FBig Brother host told singer and
OL,22,FCelebrity Traitors star Faith.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11914
SC,0014
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791995092
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADavina McCall says memory loss after
OL,4,Abrain surgery was like 'advanced
OL,5,AAlzheimer's'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"When I came out of the operation, I
OL,8,Fdidn't know I'd had an operation," she
OL,9,Frecalled. One regular member of staff
OL,10,Fwould ask McCall every day if she could
OL,11,Fremember their name. "And I'd go, 'I
OL,12,Fdon't know'."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
